{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2021-07-20 02:30:00', 'title': 'CACEIS GOES LIVE WITH RETAIL AND INSTITUTIONAL SRD II SOLUTION FROM BROADRIDGE', 'text': 'NEW YORK, LONDON AND MUNICH, JULY 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0IN RESPONSE TO NEW REGULATORY OBLIGATIONS UNDER THE UPDATED SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS DIRECTIVE (SRD II), CACEIS BANK S.A., GERMANY BRANCH HAS SELECTED GLOBAL FINTECH LEADER BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC. (NYSE:BR) TO PROVIDE IT WITH A FULL SUITE OF ADVANCED SOLUTIONS FOR THE DIRECTIVE.'}